# Engine override binaries are large and reproducible — never commit them.
# Produce them with .github/workflows/build-bare-kit-engine.yml and drop the
# downloaded artifact here as <engine>/<abi>/libbare-kit.so.
*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
# Tracked engine-build patches (source, not build output) are kept.
!patches/
!patches/*.patch
